cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CogStack — Persistent AI Cognition and Multi-Vendor Cognitive Stacking
message: If you use this specification, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Goldstein
    given-names: Niels
repository-code: https://github.com/nielsg2/cogstack-spec
abstract: >-
  A two-layer architecture for autonomous AI agent systems: a persistent
  cognition substrate (context compression, durable memory, rehydration,
  headless execution, plugin bus) and a multi-vendor cognitive-stacking model
  that orchestrates agents across providers for decorrelated diversity. The
  orchestration complement to AIDL. Published openly as prior art.
keywords:
  - AI governance
  - agentic AI
  - multi-agent systems
  - LLM orchestration
  - persistent memory
  - cognitive stacking
license: MIT
